      "title": "The Divided Line Thinking Space Arrangement",
      "description": "Your physical environment shapes the cognitive mode you enter. Architecting distinct physical cues for raw opinion versus principled problem-solving prevents mental shortcuts.",
      "category": "environment",
      "timeEstimateMinutes": 30,
