      "id": "plato-s-republic-selected-dialogues-ref-10",
      "chapterOrder": 10,
      "title": "Ladder of Love Audit",
      "prompt": "In the Symposium, Diotima says love starts with physical attraction but must evolve into loving beautiful ideas and wisdom. What passions in your life started as pure lust/hype and matured into deep, enduring craftsmanship?",
